</li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Card &amp; Character Progression:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to acquire cards with random affixes that fundamentally alter how they function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine affixes or recipes at your Base to forge powerful new cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use rewards to upgrade town facilities, enhance character cards, and strengthen your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildings and Allies (Represented as Cards):</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct buildings within limited space using card-like tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign different Allies to specific functional buildings. Each Ally provides unique combat cards, playable characters, distinct abilities, and alternative paths to victory.</p></li></ul>",
